---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import Card from '../components/Card.astro';import {articles,topics} from '../data/content';
---
<Layout title="资料库" active="library"><section data-collection data-url-filters><div class="library-tools"><label class="inline-search"><span>⌕</span><input data-query type="search" placeholder="搜索标题、摘要、标签…" aria-label="筛选资料"/></label><select data-topic-select aria-label="主题"><option value="all">全部主题</option>{topics.map(t=><option value={t.id}>{t.name}</option>)}</select><select data-level-select aria-label="阅读门槛"><option value="all">全部难度</option><option>入门</option><option>进阶</option><option>深入</option></select><button class="outline-button" data-saved-only aria-pressed="false">☆ 我的收藏</button><span class="view-switch" aria-label="资料视图"><button class="outline-button is-active" data-view="grid" aria-pressed="true">▦ 卡片</button><button class="outline-button" data-view="list" aria-pressed="false">☷ 列表</button></span></div><div class="result-bar"><span>找到 <b data-count>{articles.length}</b> 个资料集</span><span>原始文档 · 精华待提取</span></div><div class="card-grid">{articles.map(a=><Card article={a}/>)}</div><div class="empty-state" hidden><h3>还没有找到相关资料</h3><p>试试更短的关键词，或调整主题和难度筛选。</p><button class="outline-button" data-clear-filters>清除筛选</button></div></section><div class="local-data"><p>收藏与阅读进度仅保存在当前浏览器。</p><button data-export class="text-button">导出我的记录 ↓</button><label class="text-button import-label">导入记录 ↑<input type="file" accept="application/json" data-import hidden/></label></div></Layout>
